{
  "tema": 6873,
  "slug": "el-agua",
  "titulo": "Feminine nouns with stressed a- take el (el agua, un águila)",
  "subtitulo": "El agua fría, las aguas, esta agua.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Feminine nouns starting with a stressed a- or ha- (agua, alma, águila, hambre, hacha, área) take el and un in the singular, but stay feminine: el agua fría, esta agua, mucha hambre. In the plural they use las / unas: las aguas.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "When a **feminine** noun starts with a **stressed a** (or **ha-**), **la** would clash with it, so the singular takes **el**: **el agua**, **el alma**, **el hambre**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Same with **un**: **un águila**, **un hacha** (**una** is also accepted, but **un** is preferred). Also **algún / ningún**: **algún arma**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The noun is **still feminine**: adjectives and other words stay feminine: **el agua fría**, **esta agua**, **mucha hambre**, **toda el agua**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Plural: back to normal: **las aguas, unas alas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Only when the **first syllable is stressed**: **la amapola**, **la abeja** (stress elsewhere)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Exceptions: letters and names: **la a**, **la hache**, **la Ana**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **el** is a sound fix, not a sex change."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==El agua== está ==fría==.",
              "en": "The water is cold."
            },
            {
              "es": "El pájaro se lastimó ==el ala==.",
              "en": "The bird hurt its wing."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tengo ==mucha hambre==.",
              "en": "I'm really hungry."
            },
            {
              "es": "Vimos ==un águila== en la sierra.",
              "en": "We saw an eagle in the mountains."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Esta área== es solo para empleados.",
              "en": "This area is for employees only."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Las aguas== del Caribe son turquesa.",
              "en": "The waters of the Caribbean are turquoise."
            },
            {
              "es": "==La amapola== es roja.",
              "en": "The poppy is red. (stress not on the first a)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
